<title>USA: Home Properties to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Home Properties to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTESR, N.Y. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Properties said Tuesday that its board of directors has approved a stock repurchase program of up to one million shares.</p>
<p>The company said the shares will be purchased privately and on the open market at management's discretion.</p>
<p>Home also said that its action does not establish a target stock price or a specific timetable for the repurchase.</p>
<p>Home Properties is a real estate investment trust specializing in apartment communities in the Northeastern U.S.</p>
</text>
